 in the spirit of Woody Guthrie and Pete Seeger, singing about the issues of her…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":184,"text":"…epics, and to synthesize her musical explorations on the erudite Deep Natural (2002). Despite her tormented biography and rebellious attitudes, Shocked was fundamentally a collector of sonic icons a` la Ry Cooder. That standard of female folksinger migrated to the Bay Area via Barbara Manning (1),…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":190,"text":"…following decade. In New York, Roger Manning was an angry young folksinger in the tradition of early Bob Dylan and led an \"anti-folk\" crusade a` la Michelle Shocked. In Texas, James McMurtry penned richly-detailed vignettes of the depressed American wasteland, particularly on Candyland (1992). In Nebraska,…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":167484087173814,"type":"album","name":"Short Sharp Shocked","list_id":181312163526721,"list":"RYM Top — Country","src":"musthear","rank":179,"year":1988,"note":null,"yt":"DuYfymCwtFs","scaruffi":7.0},{"id":167484087173814,"type":"album","name":"Short Sharp Shocked","list_id":118798969175346,"list":"RYM Top — Country — Alt-Country","src":"musthear","rank":73,"year":1988,"note":null,"yt":"DuYfymCwtFs","scaruffi":7.0},{"id":167484087173814,"type":"album","name":"Short Sharp Shocked","list_id":44844465110460,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Folk Rock","src":"musthear","rank":161,"year":1988,"note":null,"yt":"DuYfymCwtFs","scaruffi":7.0},{"id":167484087173814,"type":"album","name":"Short Sharp Shocked","list_id":52032266791182,"list":"Scaruffi 1980s","src":"musthear","rank":572,"year":1988,"note":null,"yt":"DuYfymCwtFs","scaruffi":7.0},{"id":225674866187793,"type":"album","name":"Arkansas Traveler","list_id":167105581234386,"list":"RYM Top — Country — Country Pop","src":"musthear","rank":50,"year":1992,"note":null,"yt":"6zMlM7U-8yU","scaruffi":null},{"